+# Entrance installation view
+
+Repository integration target: **main**. Apply the supplied Site-source patch through the repository owner. The research repository was not edited and no cryptanalytic experiment was run.
+
+The new third mode is a separate entrance installation: an original SVG drawing of a flat granite slab with engraved circular rose, four engraved letters, elongated fixed carved needle and adjacent irregular faceted lodestone. Oblique/overhead controls and interpretation labels change this drawing only. The building-between-installations relationship is expressly schematic, with no geographic bearing, dimensions, spacing or sightline. Engraved N, carved needle and true north are distinct. No 247.5° or hearsay220° fit, moving magnetic needle or magnetic field is modeled.
+
+Before drawing, inspected actual pixels of Dunin's overall aerial and entrance crop and Gillogly's1280×960 compass1.jpg in this executor. Source URLs/hashes and original-image exclusion are recorded in ENTRANCE_REFERENCE_LEDGER.json. CIA confirms separate entrance/courtyard components; Dunin provides spatial context and warns of orientation uncertainty. Hanson's2005 attendee report, printedpage5, attributes the needle's intended direction toward the lodestone. It is not a measured bearing. Source photographs are not redistributed.
+
+Front/back audit: no optical geometry changed. Cipher text is front-readable; tableau row positions and asymmetric glyph apertures are mirrored so it is back-readable. A new finite6.35mm-copper ray test samples the asymmetric F aperture and solid corner from both directions on both halves. It confirms real openings, not independent printed decals. Added explanatory copy distinguishes visual mirroring, within-row spatial order, reversing the canonical97letter K4 sequence and geographic bearing reversal.
+
+Verification:80tests passed. Native Arc on thisMac rendered the complete Site at390px and1280px in same-originiframes: SVG widths328.8125px/1000px; no pageoverflow; view and label controls worked; SVG accessible name/description present; optical state byte-equivalent before/after; return to optics worked. Oblique and overhead states were also exercised in the main preview. Screenshots were available only as small app thumbnails, so no high-resolution screenshot claim. These are layout checks, not touch-device or survey validation. All238frozenvalidationfiles and291unrelatedpublishedassets remain unchanged. K1–K3 and the confirmed-only K4 row are preserved. Source/build/publication use the existing Site project and its unchanged public audience.
+
+Runtime changes: candidate and dist app.mjs,index.html,style.css,newentrance-installation.mjs; dist/RELEASE_MANIFEST.json. Tests: entrance-installation.test.mjs and front-back-apertures.test.mjs. QA: qa/entrance-view.html. Handoff/reference ledger and previous K4handoff integration wording updated. No new dependencies.
